  "problem": "Given the recurrence relation\n\n$$\n{a}_{n+1}=6{a}_{n}-5{a}_{n-1},\\,{a}_{1}=1,\\,{a}_{2}=21,\\,n\\in N,\\,n\\ge 2\n$$\n\nuse strong induction to prove the following statement:\n\n$$\n{a}_{n}={5}^{n}-4,\\,∀n\\in N\n$$",
